# Ward--Discard a card cannot be paid with no card to discard: Bot2 plays and casts everything it holds (five Moxen, an
# Island, Black Lotus drawn on turn 2) but the Lightning Bolt, so its hand is empty when the ward trigger resolves. The Bolt is countered (no question asked, nothing to pay with) and
# the Saboteur lives.

